<title>JAPAN: Japan life insurer group chief to hold briefing.</title>
<headline>Japan life insurer group chief to hold briefing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenjiro Hata, chief of Japan's life insurance association, will hold a news conference at 2.45 p.m. (0545 GMT) on Friday concerning the Finance Ministry's order to  Nissan Mutual Life Insurance Co to halt some operations.</p>
<p>Hata is also president of Meiji Mutual Life Insurance Co.</p>
</text>
